WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:12.468
Subtitles by explosiveskull


00:01:46.911 --> 00:01:48.580
<i>Mayday. Mayday.</i>


00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:50.984
<i>Engine failure.
We are in a spin.</i>


00:01:53.355 --> 00:01:55.923
<i>Mission Control,
can you hear me?</i>


00:01:56.925 --> 00:01:59.095
<i>Engine failure. Mayday!</i>


00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:04.235
<i>We're in a spin!
I can't pull us out of it!</i>


00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.639
<i>Can anybody read me?</i>


00:02:11.145 --> 00:02:14.316
<i>Crew, prepare yourself
for impact!</i>


00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:16.052
<i>We're going in hot!</i>


00:03:10.858 --> 00:03:11.893
Hmm?


00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:19.870
<i>Analyzing.</i>


00:03:19.904 --> 00:03:21.239
<i>Oxygen detected.</i>


00:03:39.764 --> 00:03:41.201
What?


00:04:02.795 --> 00:04:04.798
This is Captain Max Cloud. Over.


00:04:08.937 --> 00:04:11.774
Repeat.
This is Captain Max Cloud.


00:04:11.808 --> 00:04:13.078
Do you read? Over.


00:04:13.111 --> 00:04:14.545
<i>We read you, Max.</i>


00:04:14.578 --> 00:04:16.181
<i>You're breaking up,
but we read you.</i>


00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:17.849
<i>Thank God you're alive.</i>


00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:19.418
<i>The galaxy would be lost
without you.</i>


00:04:19.453 --> 00:04:21.188
We jumped into hyperspace


00:04:21.221 --> 00:04:23.324
and had a total loss
of all power upon reentry,


00:04:23.358 --> 00:04:26.528
but I'm Max Cloud,
and I don't have time for death.


00:04:26.562 --> 00:04:29.232
<i>Good news
is we have your location.</i>


00:04:29.266 --> 00:04:31.535
<i>- And the bad?
- Your location.</i>


00:04:31.569 --> 00:04:34.373
<i>I'm afraid you've come down
on Alpha Zed-3.</i>


00:04:34.406 --> 00:04:36.475
Alpha Ze...


00:04:36.508 --> 00:04:38.878
Oh, shit.


00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.581
We've landed on Heinous.


00:04:40.614 --> 00:04:43.350
Woah. Uh, Heinous?


00:04:43.384 --> 00:04:45.421
Sorry. Why is that a, um,


00:04:45.454 --> 00:04:48.858
"I'm afraid you have"
type of situation?


00:04:48.891 --> 00:04:51.128
The entire planet of Heinous
is a prison


00:04:51.161 --> 00:04:55.267
for the galaxy's most dangerous,
violent, and immoral criminals.


00:04:55.301 --> 00:04:56.969
That's far from ideal.


00:04:57.002 --> 00:04:58.971
<i>I'm afraid so.</i>


00:04:59.004 --> 00:05:01.876
<i>Sit tight. A rescue ship
will be with you in six hours.</i>


00:05:01.909 --> 00:05:04.246
Okay. Six hours, not a problem.


00:05:04.279 --> 00:05:06.115
Let me just sweep
the rest of the ship,


00:05:06.149 --> 00:05:08.185
look for other survivors,


00:05:08.218 --> 00:05:10.988
and check that the main hull of
the ship has not been breached.


00:05:17.297 --> 00:05:19.167
I'm gonna gamble
it may have been.


00:05:21.235 --> 00:05:22.504
What's your name, soldier?


00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:24.240
Jake, the chef.


00:05:24.274 --> 00:05:25.508
Chef?


00:05:25.542 --> 00:05:27.645
I have literally
cooked you food


00:05:27.678 --> 00:05:29.413
every day for the past...


00:05:29.447 --> 00:05:30.981
six months.


00:05:31.015 --> 00:05:33.553
Well, Max Cloud
meets many people.


00:05:33.586 --> 00:05:36.590
I mean, like three times a day
every day.


00:05:38.393 --> 00:05:41.029
Time to move. We need to sweep
the rest of the ship,


00:05:41.062 --> 00:05:42.131
look for other survivors.


00:05:42.164 --> 00:05:43.399
Do you copy me, soldier?


00:05:43.432 --> 00:05:45.135
Yeah. Yeah.


00:05:45.168 --> 00:05:48.339
Sweep the ship and, uh,
look for survivors.


00:05:48.373 --> 00:05:51.276
I said,
"Do you copy me, soldier?"


00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.578
I just did...


00:05:52.611 --> 00:05:55.515
Oh, right!
Uh, um, yeah, copy that.


00:06:26.591 --> 00:06:28.294
Your Greatness, I...


00:06:28.327 --> 00:06:32.331
Do not enter
on my personal time, Scavenger.


00:06:32.365 --> 00:06:36.538
Revengor, this is
worth the interruption.


00:06:36.571 --> 00:06:39.141
How rude.


00:06:39.175 --> 00:06:42.480
Unless it is something from
my top 10 list of wanted items,


00:06:42.513 --> 00:06:44.182
step off.


00:06:46.785 --> 00:06:50.290
You have perked my curiosity.


00:06:50.323 --> 00:06:53.194
Surely not top five.


00:06:53.227 --> 00:06:55.095
Yes!


00:06:56.331 --> 00:06:57.300
No.


00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:58.467
No.


00:06:58.501 --> 00:07:00.571
The tension is mounting.


00:07:00.604 --> 00:07:02.073
No.


00:07:03.039 --> 00:07:04.742
Yes.


00:07:04.776 --> 00:07:08.046
Ah! Yes!


00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.517
I knew this day would come.


00:07:13.255 --> 00:07:15.022
How exciting.


00:07:33.214 --> 00:07:34.383
Hello.


00:07:34.416 --> 00:07:36.352
Sarah Noble here,


00:07:36.385 --> 00:07:39.223
unofficial
world gaming champion.


00:07:39.257 --> 00:07:40.658
How are you doing, Cowboy?


00:07:40.691 --> 00:07:42.728
<i>Hey! How you know it was me?</i>


00:07:42.761 --> 00:07:45.732
'Cause you're
the only one who ever calls me.


00:07:47.367 --> 00:07:49.403
And I can hear you
chewing a hot dog.


00:07:49.436 --> 00:07:51.238
<i>From a tin for the win.</i>


00:07:52.374 --> 00:07:53.342
<i>So you coming tomorrow?</i>


00:07:53.376 --> 00:07:55.077
Ucch. No.


00:07:55.111 --> 00:07:57.347
Dad's heading out,
so I have to stay in


00:07:57.381 --> 00:07:59.383
and wait for a delivery for him.


00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:02.154
<i>So? You can come out for a bit.
He won't know.</i>


00:08:02.187 --> 00:08:04.189
I can't.


00:08:04.223 --> 00:08:06.092
I'm not allowed, Cowboy.


00:08:06.126 --> 00:08:07.762
I promised him
I wouldn't go out.


00:08:07.795 --> 00:08:09.231
I gotta go.


00:08:09.264 --> 00:08:10.866
<i>Yeah, I know. You gotta go.</i>


00:08:10.899 --> 00:08:12.301
<i>Night, Sarah.</i>


00:08:12.334 --> 00:08:13.669
Good night, Cowboy.


00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.746
Sarah!


00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.349
Make sure you turn
that console off before bed,


00:08:23.382 --> 00:08:24.551
or it'll overheat.


00:08:24.585 --> 00:08:26.286
I will.


00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:28.389
I always do.


00:08:48.817 --> 00:08:51.520
Uh, Dad, what did I tell you
about knocking?


00:08:51.554 --> 00:08:53.690
Well, I would knock
if I thought I was gonna


00:08:53.724 --> 00:08:56.561
catch you doing something other
than playing those damn games.


00:08:56.594 --> 00:08:58.663
Oh, but I'm so close
to finishing it, though.


00:08:58.696 --> 00:09:00.834
You know what? No, that's it.


00:09:00.867 --> 00:09:03.470
I'm banning all video games
this weekend.


00:09:03.503 --> 00:09:05.540
Come on, Dad.
Get a grip.


00:09:05.574 --> 00:09:07.175
You can't speak to me like that


00:09:07.209 --> 00:09:08.745
and expect
to get away with it, Sarah.


00:09:08.778 --> 00:09:10.380
Now turn it off.


00:09:11.514 --> 00:09:12.650
Now.


00:09:13.684 --> 00:09:15.654
No, sure.


00:09:15.687 --> 00:09:16.722
You got it.


00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:20.460
You know, your mother


00:09:20.494 --> 00:09:22.329
hated you being
on that thing all the time.


00:09:22.362 --> 00:09:23.931
Jeez.


00:09:23.965 --> 00:09:26.435
You have serious issues, man.


00:09:26.468 --> 00:09:29.204
Watch it with that back talk,
young lady.


00:09:39.353 --> 00:09:41.288
Huh. What's this?


00:09:43.258 --> 00:09:44.693
No way.


00:09:44.726 --> 00:09:46.696
Secret room?


00:09:47.797 --> 00:09:49.766
How have I never
seen this before?


00:10:00.448 --> 00:10:03.318
I'm the Space Witch.
I know all.


00:10:03.351 --> 00:10:06.923
I know everything about you,
your every desire.


00:10:06.956 --> 00:10:09.560
I'm sorry.
Did you just say, "Space Witch"?


00:10:09.593 --> 00:10:12.297
Yeah, Space Witch.


00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.332
But you're a...


00:10:14.365 --> 00:10:17.904
Well, I mean,
you look like a man.


00:10:17.938 --> 00:10:19.574
So?


00:10:19.607 --> 00:10:21.043
Well, wouldn't that
make you a space wizard?


00:10:21.076 --> 00:10:23.645
Woah! How dare you?


00:10:23.679 --> 00:10:26.449
Men can be witches as well,
I'll have you know.


00:10:26.483 --> 00:10:28.285
Nonsense!


00:10:28.319 --> 00:10:31.056
A man could be a witch
as much as a woman could...


00:10:31.089 --> 00:10:32.958
captain a ship.


00:10:32.991 --> 00:10:35.629
Yeah, well...


00:10:35.662 --> 00:10:36.729
I'm trying to help you,
Max Cloud.


00:10:36.763 --> 00:10:38.600
Don't be a douche bag.


00:10:38.633 --> 00:10:44.807
Max Cloud does not need help
from weird man witches.


00:10:46.376 --> 00:10:47.811
That's actually quite hurtful.


00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.451
No, Max, maybe we do.


00:10:52.484 --> 00:10:53.820
Sarah, who are you...


00:10:54.921 --> 00:10:59.326
Sarah, what did I just tell you?


00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.996
You know, if you're
gonna behave like a child,


00:11:01.029 --> 00:11:02.865
then I'm gonna have
to treat you like a child.


00:11:04.033 --> 00:11:06.004
No, Dad, don't turn it off.


00:11:06.037 --> 00:11:08.039
Okay, I think
I just found an Easter egg.


00:11:08.072 --> 00:11:10.441
This might be the last time
I find this place.


00:11:10.475 --> 00:11:11.977
Dad, please.


00:11:14.514 --> 00:11:16.484
I'm confiscating
your controller.


00:11:16.517 --> 00:11:18.719
<i>You'll get it back when you
learn to have a little respect.</i>


00:11:18.754 --> 00:11:19.822
<i>No! Don't!</i>


00:11:19.855 --> 00:11:21.456
<i>What am I meant to do?</i>


00:11:22.458 --> 00:11:23.627
<i>Don't! You're just...</i>


00:11:23.661 --> 00:11:26.030
<i>You're just being mean.</i>


00:11:30.036 --> 00:11:32.672
So unfair.


00:11:34.508 --> 00:11:36.376
<i>I wish I could just play
video games all day,</i>


00:11:36.411 --> 00:11:39.348
<i>every day, and no one
could ever stop me.</i>


00:12:03.181 --> 00:12:05.016
Sarah...


00:12:05.049 --> 00:12:06.451
see you later.


00:12:06.484 --> 00:12:07.953
There's a pizza in the freezer.


00:12:07.987 --> 00:12:09.623
I won't be back 'til late.


00:12:09.656 --> 00:12:11.057
Call me if you need anything.


00:12:13.828 --> 00:12:15.564
Okay, I'm going.


00:12:19.636 --> 00:12:21.839
Yo!


00:12:21.872 --> 00:12:24.109
There's a package
at the back door!


00:12:24.142 --> 00:12:25.877
Want me to bring it up?


00:12:28.948 --> 00:12:32.086
Fear is not near. Cowboy is...


00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.154
here.


00:12:35.591 --> 00:12:36.725
Sarah!


00:12:38.094 --> 00:12:39.130
Ser!


00:12:41.132 --> 00:12:42.534
Where you at?


00:12:46.973 --> 00:12:48.641
Huh.


00:12:55.551 --> 00:12:56.585
Okay.


00:13:05.966 --> 00:13:07.634
Jake?


00:13:07.667 --> 00:13:10.871
Who plays as Jake?


00:13:10.905 --> 00:13:13.476
I didn't even know
you could switch characters.


00:13:14.243 --> 00:13:16.580
This is a dark moment.


00:13:21.221 --> 00:13:22.555
All right.


00:13:22.588 --> 00:13:24.524
Jake, the useless chef, it is.


00:13:39.044 --> 00:13:41.580
Where did that Space Wizard go?


00:13:44.817 --> 00:13:46.053
Behind me.


00:13:46.086 --> 00:13:48.623
Max Cloud always leads the way.


00:13:48.656 --> 00:13:49.925
Max Cloud?


00:13:49.959 --> 00:13:51.627
What the...


00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.997
Hell, you... you are Max Cloud,
aren't you?


00:13:54.966 --> 00:13:56.066
Is this real?


00:13:56.099 --> 00:13:57.702
Yes, I'm real.


00:13:57.735 --> 00:14:00.105
I am Max Cloud,
intergalactic space hero


00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:01.908
and captain of this ship,


00:14:01.941 --> 00:14:04.812
and you are someone
who makes food or something.


00:14:04.845 --> 00:14:07.148
What is wrong with you, soldier?
We've already done this.


00:14:07.181 --> 00:14:09.719
I c-can't believe I'm standing
in front of Max Cloud.


00:14:09.752 --> 00:14:12.689
I must be dreaming.
C-Can I touch you?


00:14:14.191 --> 00:14:17.028
Stand down, soldier,
immediately.


00:14:17.063 --> 00:14:18.864
Okay.


00:14:18.898 --> 00:14:20.368
All right, this is a dream.


00:14:20.401 --> 00:14:22.936
This has to be a dream.
I mean...


00:14:22.969 --> 00:14:25.873
it feels real.


00:14:25.907 --> 00:14:27.176
I mean, you feel...


00:14:30.013 --> 00:14:30.980
Huh?


00:14:31.014 --> 00:14:33.351
And I feel...


00:14:38.858 --> 00:14:40.626
Pull yourself together, soldier!


00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.995
We don't have time for this!


00:14:44.198 --> 00:14:45.900
Okay.


00:14:45.934 --> 00:14:49.004
Okay. Whatever the hell
is going on here...


00:14:49.973 --> 00:14:52.310
I'm in a spaceship...


00:14:52.343 --> 00:14:53.778
with Max Cloud.


00:14:56.449 --> 00:14:59.253
That is insanely cool.


00:14:59.286 --> 00:15:00.955
<i>Cowboy?</i>


00:15:00.988 --> 00:15:02.990
Holy smokes!


00:15:03.023 --> 00:15:04.926
<i>Cowboy, i-is that you?</i>


00:15:05.928 --> 00:15:07.663
How are you doing that?


00:15:07.697 --> 00:15:10.301
Uh, let me pause this.


00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.440
Weird.


00:15:14.473 --> 00:15:16.409
Game won't pause.


00:15:16.443 --> 00:15:19.112
See, this is what I'm telling
you about secondhand games,


00:15:19.146 --> 00:15:20.882
super sketchy.


00:15:20.915 --> 00:15:23.419
<i>This one is definitely sketchy.
That's for sure.</i>


00:15:25.355 --> 00:15:27.791
<i>- I'll just restart it.
- No!</i>


00:15:27.825 --> 00:15:30.027
Okay.


00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.164
I mean,
you're not even that far in.


00:15:32.197 --> 00:15:34.032
<i>You have to promise me</i>


00:15:34.065 --> 00:15:36.936
<i>you won't restart the game
or hit the power.</i>


00:15:36.969 --> 00:15:38.772
<i>- Okay.
- Promise me.</i>


00:15:39.741 --> 00:15:42.445
Yeah, I promise.


00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.849
What is going on?


00:15:45.882 --> 00:15:48.084
<i>Don't freak out.</i>


00:15:48.118 --> 00:15:50.789
I am a paragon of chill,
all right?


00:15:50.822 --> 00:15:53.259
<i>I'm just gonna
come straight out with it.</i>


00:15:53.293 --> 00:15:55.161
<i>I'm pretty sure
I'm in the game.</i>


00:15:56.897 --> 00:15:58.833
Uh, good one.


00:15:58.867 --> 00:16:01.236
Now come on. Come out.
Where are you?


00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.775
<i>In the game. I can see
Max Cloud in the flesh.</i>


00:16:04.808 --> 00:16:06.877
<i>He's standing
right in front of me.</i>


00:16:08.046 --> 00:16:11.251
Sarah, this is
a really weird joke.


00:16:11.284 --> 00:16:13.254
I'm looking at a screen
right now,


00:16:13.287 --> 00:16:17.858
and all I can see is Max Cloud
and Jake, nobody else.


00:16:17.892 --> 00:16:20.263
<i>What?! Oh, God, I knew it.</i>


00:16:20.296 --> 00:16:22.064
<i>I'm Jake, aren't I?</i>


00:16:22.097 --> 00:16:23.968
<i>Oh, why couldn't I
have turned into Max?</i>


00:16:24.001 --> 00:16:26.904
<i>Seriously?
Jake's literally the worst.</i>


00:16:28.474 --> 00:16:30.309
<i>I've seen Big.</i>


00:16:30.343 --> 00:16:33.045
<i>I've seen Fred Savage's
magnificent Vice Versa,</i>


00:16:33.079 --> 00:16:35.115
so I know these things
are possible.


00:16:35.148 --> 00:16:36.918
<i>Help me, Cowboy.</i>


00:16:36.951 --> 00:16:38.854
<i>I went to bed,
and the next thing I know,</i>


00:16:38.887 --> 00:16:41.123
<i>I'm here
on Max Cloud's spaceship.</i>


00:16:41.156 --> 00:16:43.828
This...


00:16:43.861 --> 00:16:46.030
this... this is so cool!


00:16:46.999 --> 00:16:50.371
Look, if... if you're Jake


00:16:50.404 --> 00:16:52.872
and I'm playing as Jake,


00:16:52.906 --> 00:16:55.410
does that mean
I'm controlling you?


00:16:55.443 --> 00:16:57.913
<i>Uh, I guess so.</i>


00:17:02.052 --> 00:17:04.822
Aw, man, this is so awesome.


00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.865
What's the danger, soldier?


00:17:11.898 --> 00:17:13.435
You doing it?


00:17:13.468 --> 00:17:16.171
<i>Yes, I'm doing it. Now stop.</i>


00:17:26.419 --> 00:17:28.289
But it's so funny.


00:17:28.323 --> 00:17:31.859
<i>Y-you're making me
look stupid in front of Max.</i>


00:17:34.062 --> 00:17:35.898
Okay.


00:17:35.931 --> 00:17:37.199
Party pooper.


00:17:40.304 --> 00:17:42.006
Heh.


00:17:44.208 --> 00:17:45.877
Must be something
in the atmosphere, sir.


00:17:45.912 --> 00:17:47.582
Y-you need to watch out
for that.


00:17:49.284 --> 00:17:51.885
I need to watch out for that?


00:17:51.919 --> 00:17:53.989
You need to watch out.


00:17:59.162 --> 00:18:01.300
What if I can't get out?


00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:03.902
<i>I didn't think of that.
What do we do?</i>


00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.078
Okay, Sarah, keep it together.


00:18:11.112 --> 00:18:13.216
You know this game.


00:18:13.249 --> 00:18:14.917
Figure this shit out.


00:18:16.219 --> 00:18:18.088
The Space Witch.


00:18:18.122 --> 00:18:19.256
<i>Space Witch?</i>


00:18:20.659 --> 00:18:22.928
<i>Okay, Cowboy,
there's a Space Witch</i>


00:18:22.962 --> 00:18:24.965
<i>hidden somewhere on Max's ship.</i>


00:18:24.998 --> 00:18:26.567
<i>- We need to find him.
- Him?</i>


00:18:26.601 --> 00:18:28.570
<i>I think he might be
my way out of here.</i>


00:18:28.604 --> 00:18:31.541
<i>- Okay. How do we do that?
- Well, I don't know, Cowboy.</i>


00:18:31.574 --> 00:18:33.676
<i>I'm currently stuck
inside a video game.</i>


00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.280
<i>- Can you get some help?
- I can't leave, Sarah.</i>


00:18:36.314 --> 00:18:38.717
The game won't pause,
and you only have one life left.


00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:41.052
<i>Then we only have
one option right now.</i>


00:18:41.086 --> 00:18:43.424
<i>You have to play.</i>


00:18:43.457 --> 00:18:46.327
Okay. That's no pressure, then.


00:18:46.361 --> 00:18:47.663
I'm gonna need some nutrition.


00:18:57.643 --> 00:18:59.978
Okay. You got this, buddy.


00:19:00.012 --> 00:19:02.616
<i>Cowboy, concentrate.</i>


00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:05.052
<i>And don't talk
with your mouth full.</i>


00:19:06.788 --> 00:19:07.756
What was that?


00:19:07.789 --> 00:19:09.693
Uh, wait.


00:19:09.726 --> 00:19:13.197
Um, before you go
all hunter-killer mode,


00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.699
you might not want
to go in there.


00:19:14.732 --> 00:19:16.335
We left the deck seconds ago.


00:19:16.368 --> 00:19:18.102
- It's empty.
- Ah!


00:19:18.136 --> 00:19:21.074
But there's a hole in the deck,
big hole.


00:19:21.107 --> 00:19:22.610
Well, if there is
something in there,


00:19:22.643 --> 00:19:24.312
it's not gonna be very friendly,


00:19:24.346 --> 00:19:26.448
so whatever's on
the other side of those doors,


00:19:26.482 --> 00:19:28.618
we kill. Is that understood?


00:19:29.586 --> 00:19:30.554
"We"?


00:19:30.588 --> 00:19:31.622
Yeah.


00:19:46.476 --> 00:19:48.277
Okay, concentrate, Cowboy.


00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.614
Okay, then.


00:19:49.647 --> 00:19:52.383
Who wants the first dance?


00:20:12.545 --> 00:20:14.279
<i>Finish him.</i>


00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.819
<i>K.O.!</i>


00:20:19.854 --> 00:20:21.723
<i>Round one. Fight!</i>


00:20:27.765 --> 00:20:29.533
<i>- Perfect.
- Ho!</i>


00:20:29.567 --> 00:20:31.101
<i>K.O.</i>


00:20:40.715 --> 00:20:41.684
Hah!


00:20:41.717 --> 00:20:43.787
Fear is not near.


00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:46.490
Max Cloud is here.


00:20:47.726 --> 00:20:48.726
Not bad.


00:20:48.759 --> 00:20:50.596
Not bad at all.


00:20:50.629 --> 00:20:52.799
That guy's head came
completely off his shoulders.


00:20:52.832 --> 00:20:55.335
Now all we need to do


00:20:55.369 --> 00:20:57.672
is figure out a way
to block that hole.


00:20:57.706 --> 00:20:59.841
Uh, we need to get
the plasma-gun thing,


00:20:59.874 --> 00:21:02.211
and then we sling them up there,
and then we fire.


00:21:02.244 --> 00:21:04.448
I have a plan. Take this.


00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:07.217
On my cue...


00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.554
Uh, Cowboy...


00:21:08.587 --> 00:21:09.822
<i>Mm-hmm.</i>


00:21:10.789 --> 00:21:11.758
Okay.


00:21:11.791 --> 00:21:13.361
Ready?


00:21:13.394 --> 00:21:16.129
3, 2, 1...


00:21:25.843 --> 00:21:26.911
Let's move.


00:21:31.985 --> 00:21:33.720
You excited to meet my girl?


00:21:33.754 --> 00:21:35.590
My English rose?


00:21:35.624 --> 00:21:36.791
<i>In your dreams.</i>


00:21:36.824 --> 00:21:38.761
Just tell her Cowboy says hi.


00:21:40.964 --> 00:21:42.867
She'll know what it means.


00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.502
I'd be pretty concerned


00:21:44.535 --> 00:21:46.303
if she didn't know
what "Hi" means, Cowboy.


00:21:48.239 --> 00:21:49.909
Identify yourself.


00:21:49.942 --> 00:21:51.412
I said, "Identify..."


00:21:51.445 --> 00:21:52.946
Commander Rexy.


00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:54.716
I'm gonna need
visual confirmation on that.


00:21:54.749 --> 00:21:56.652
- It's me, Max.
- Who?


00:21:56.686 --> 00:21:58.320
Who are you?


00:21:58.354 --> 00:22:00.256
Max, I know you know it's me.


00:22:00.289 --> 00:22:02.427
How do you know
that I know it's you?


00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.730
Ah, Commander Rexy.


00:22:04.763 --> 00:22:06.231
Captain,
thank goodness I found you.


00:22:06.265 --> 00:22:07.867
The galaxy depends on you.


00:22:07.901 --> 00:22:09.670
You're the only space hero
who can save this ship.


00:22:09.704 --> 00:22:11.005
We'd be doomed without you.


00:22:11.038 --> 00:22:12.574
Tell me what happened,
Commander.


00:22:12.607 --> 00:22:14.609
Where's the rest of my crew?


00:22:14.643 --> 00:22:15.912
Dead.


00:22:15.945 --> 00:22:17.312
Fully dead.


00:22:18.448 --> 00:22:20.017
Mission report, Commander.


00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:21.952
You're so annoying.


00:22:21.985 --> 00:22:25.991
Rexy's kinda different here.
She's... she's sassy.


00:22:26.025 --> 00:22:28.696
You're just saying that
'cause you're jealous.


00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:29.896
What happened, Commander?


00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:31.900
Well, the last thing I remember


00:22:31.934 --> 00:22:34.436
was jumping into hyperspace.


00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:36.840
When I came to,
the ship was torn apart,


00:22:36.873 --> 00:22:38.509
and I was floating.


00:22:38.542 --> 00:22:41.045
- Floating where?
- In space.


00:22:41.078 --> 00:22:43.583
I pulled myself back on board,
and here I am.


00:22:43.616 --> 00:22:45.051
- Ah.
- We're the only survivors.


00:22:45.084 --> 00:22:47.821
Everyone else is dead.


00:22:47.855 --> 00:22:49.991
Hmm. Yeah, that's basically it.


00:22:50.024 --> 00:22:52.494
The worst place we
could have ended up is Heinous.


00:22:52.527 --> 00:22:54.498
Well, we might
have to get used to it, Max.


00:22:54.531 --> 00:22:55.631
Nonsense!


00:23:00.773 --> 00:23:03.942
Max Cloud
will not get used to Heinous.


00:23:06.747 --> 00:23:09.451
They're coming. Get ready.


00:23:10.986 --> 00:23:14.024
Well, we don't have to run
into every situation head-on.


00:23:14.057 --> 00:23:15.592
'Course we do. That's the...


00:23:15.626 --> 00:23:17.762
- Max Cloud...
- Max Cloud way! Yay!


00:23:17.796 --> 00:23:20.099
I have a different idea.


00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:22.367
Since when did you
start piping up?


00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:23.637
- Follow me.
- Soldier!


00:23:25.106 --> 00:23:26.072
Hyah!


00:23:36.854 --> 00:23:41.359
Okay, Sarah.
Let me take you somewhere safe.


00:23:43.497 --> 00:23:44.698
Max Cloud's bedroom.


00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:47.334
Well, it's kinda safe.


00:23:52.442 --> 00:23:54.645
It looks like securing
the ship's out of the question.


00:23:54.679 --> 00:23:56.581
Have you lost your mind,
soldier?


00:23:56.614 --> 00:24:00.018
I will kill
each and every one of them.


00:24:00.052 --> 00:24:01.754
I respect you. In fact,


00:24:01.788 --> 00:24:03.924
- I admire you, but...
- Well, most people do.


00:24:03.958 --> 00:24:06.161
I think...


00:24:06.194 --> 00:24:08.163
we need to be sensible
about this.


00:24:08.196 --> 00:24:11.434
If we can move forward without
a battle at every corner,


00:24:11.468 --> 00:24:12.769
then that would be great,


00:24:12.803 --> 00:24:14.772
because I don't want
to die here.


00:24:14.806 --> 00:24:18.811
To die on Max Cloud's ship would
be an honorable death, soldier.


00:24:18.844 --> 00:24:20.547
- I've got a plan.
- Hmm.


00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:22.582
- Why don't we...
- Hmm.


00:24:22.616 --> 00:24:24.553
just sit here and do nothing?


00:24:24.586 --> 00:24:25.921
Hmm.


00:24:25.954 --> 00:24:27.523
We could
put our feet up...


00:24:27.557 --> 00:24:29.126
- Hmm.
- watch a video.


00:24:29.159 --> 00:24:31.195
- Hmm.
- We deserve it.


00:24:31.228 --> 00:24:32.464
Hmm.


00:24:33.864 --> 00:24:35.033
Hogwash!


00:24:35.066 --> 00:24:37.837
Commander, chef, on me.


00:24:39.940 --> 00:24:43.478
Come get some,
intergalactic space scum!


00:24:43.511 --> 00:24:44.812
Max!


00:24:47.150 --> 00:24:48.551
He'll be fine.


00:24:48.585 --> 00:24:50.154
We gotta help him.


00:24:50.187 --> 00:24:51.989
If he dies, we die.


00:24:54.827 --> 00:24:55.827
Okay!


00:24:56.996 --> 00:24:58.899
<i>We can do this.</i>


00:24:58.933 --> 00:25:00.100
<i>You ready, Cowboy?</i>


00:25:00.134 --> 00:25:01.603
Sarah, this part
always kills me,


00:25:01.636 --> 00:25:03.105
even when I'm playing as Max.


00:25:03.139 --> 00:25:04.907
<i>Keep it together.</i>


00:25:04.941 --> 00:25:07.978
<i>Listen to my voice,
and do exactly as I say.</i>


00:25:08.011 --> 00:25:09.046
Okay.


00:25:16.156 --> 00:25:17.190
Hey.


00:25:18.993 --> 00:25:21.163
<i>Down, A, B, B.</i>


00:25:27.538 --> 00:25:28.707
Good work, soldier.


00:25:28.740 --> 00:25:29.907
Let's move.


00:25:29.940 --> 00:25:32.144
Yahoo!


00:25:32.178 --> 00:25:34.680
<i>Stay focused, Cowboy.</i>


00:25:34.714 --> 00:25:36.249
We are killing it!


00:25:36.283 --> 00:25:38.151
I've never played this well
before in my life.


00:26:49.315 --> 00:26:51.085
I'm sick and tired...


00:26:51.118 --> 00:26:53.287
of you Heinous scum!


00:27:02.333 --> 00:27:04.035
It's a dead end.


00:27:04.068 --> 00:27:07.206
I scared them off
with an act of pure violence.


00:27:08.875 --> 00:27:10.678
Well,
what about those guys?


00:27:10.711 --> 00:27:13.115
Fall back!


00:27:14.883 --> 00:27:16.385
Follow me, soldiers!


00:27:16.419 --> 00:27:18.921
The whole planet's gone to shit!


00:27:29.270 --> 00:27:31.305
No way.


00:27:31.339 --> 00:27:33.075
Is it really...


00:27:33.108 --> 00:27:35.344
Brock Donnelly,
intergalactic bounty hunter?


00:27:59.477 --> 00:28:02.714
Give me a damn good
reason not to kill you.


00:28:08.022 --> 00:28:09.457
<i>Can you see this, Cowboy?</i>


00:28:09.491 --> 00:28:12.227
Yeah. We're lucky
he hasn't killed you, too.


00:28:12.260 --> 00:28:14.398
Oh, my God,
it's the Brock Donnelly.


00:28:15.832 --> 00:28:17.335
Keep your shit together!


00:28:17.368 --> 00:28:19.137
<i>Stop fangirling, Sarah.</i>


00:28:19.170 --> 00:28:20.305
<i>It's embarrassing.</i>


00:28:20.338 --> 00:28:21.440
Hello, dear.


00:28:22.441 --> 00:28:23.743
Brock Donnelly.


00:28:23.777 --> 00:28:24.945
I know. I'm Sar...


00:28:24.978 --> 00:28:26.914
I'm Jake! I'm Jake.


00:28:26.948 --> 00:28:28.082
I'm Jake.


00:28:31.521 --> 00:28:32.989
He always like that?


00:28:33.022 --> 00:28:35.226
No, not normally.


00:28:37.328 --> 00:28:38.930
Works for me.


00:28:40.166 --> 00:28:42.401
Ugh. Gross.


00:28:42.435 --> 00:28:44.438
You know, Brock's my guy,


00:28:44.471 --> 00:28:48.310
but if he even thinks about
trying anything with Rexy,


00:28:48.344 --> 00:28:49.745
oh, man.


00:28:55.186 --> 00:28:56.988
Inside. Hurry up.


00:28:57.021 --> 00:29:00.225
Don't even think about it.
That's Max Cloud's seat.


00:29:01.928 --> 00:29:03.530
What are you doing
on my ship, prisoner?


00:29:03.564 --> 00:29:05.199
Tell him, Brock.


00:29:05.232 --> 00:29:07.570
- Tell him about the ship.
- Okay.


00:29:07.603 --> 00:29:11.340
As soon as space clown here
puts his gun down.


00:29:11.374 --> 00:29:12.909
No?


00:29:17.584 --> 00:29:19.285
Suit yourself, spandex.


00:29:31.100 --> 00:29:34.271
I came here tracking a bounty...


00:29:34.305 --> 00:29:35.975
Shee.


00:29:38.444 --> 00:29:39.980
Look at her.


00:29:40.013 --> 00:29:43.051
What a piece of work, eh?


00:29:43.084 --> 00:29:46.556
Wanted on over
12 different planets.


00:29:48.358 --> 00:29:51.028
I finally tracked her
here to Heinous.


00:29:52.564 --> 00:29:56.301
Perfect place for a criminal
to disappear, right?


00:29:56.335 --> 00:29:59.473
I was tracking her
through the mountains.


00:29:59.506 --> 00:30:01.408
I knew she was close.


00:30:03.346 --> 00:30:06.483
I could almost smell
the evil in the air,


00:30:06.516 --> 00:30:08.418
I mean, taste it.


00:30:08.452 --> 00:30:10.556
Then I look up into the sky,


00:30:10.589 --> 00:30:13.660
and I see the ship,
and I think, "That's weird.


00:30:13.693 --> 00:30:15.494
That looks like my ship."


00:30:16.529 --> 00:30:19.165
- I realize...
- It was his ship.


00:30:19.199 --> 00:30:21.336
It was my ship.


00:30:21.370 --> 00:30:24.540
So now I find myself here...


00:30:26.275 --> 00:30:27.978
helping you guys.


00:30:28.011 --> 00:30:31.049
And I'm prepared
to give up a 35-year record


00:30:31.082 --> 00:30:36.256
of never losing a bounty
to get off this rock, Heinous.


00:30:36.289 --> 00:30:40.194
So you gonna lower that gun?


00:30:41.396 --> 00:30:43.533
'Cause I'm
the only help you got.


00:30:45.235 --> 00:30:46.705
You have a lot more
to worry about


00:30:46.738 --> 00:30:49.306
than some old space cowboy.


00:30:49.340 --> 00:30:51.009
Max Cloud, lower that gun.


00:30:51.042 --> 00:30:53.079
We do not have time
for your peacocking.


00:30:53.112 --> 00:30:58.253
Okay, let's get
this tin can in the sky.


00:31:00.488 --> 00:31:02.959
I will have you know
that this tin can


00:31:02.993 --> 00:31:04.695
is the fastest ship
in the galaxy.


00:31:04.729 --> 00:31:07.965
Now just you remember
who you're talking to.


00:31:07.999 --> 00:31:11.671
I have absolutely no idea
who the hell you are.


00:31:11.704 --> 00:31:14.008
But I do know one thing.


00:31:14.041 --> 00:31:17.245
If you don't listen to me,
you're gonna be turned into


00:31:17.279 --> 00:31:20.115
pink larvunian lasagna
in the next few hours.


00:31:20.148 --> 00:31:22.485
I can handle
those degenerates out there.


00:31:22.518 --> 00:31:24.121
Don't you worry about that.


00:31:25.088 --> 00:31:26.658
Oh, listen, sunshine.


00:31:26.691 --> 00:31:29.495
It ain't the pansies out there
that worry me.


00:31:29.528 --> 00:31:30.563
Oh, no.


00:31:32.767 --> 00:31:35.069
You see
them two sisters up there?


00:31:37.271 --> 00:31:39.074
That's what concerns me.


00:31:40.510 --> 00:31:44.650
They remind me of these twins
I knew once on Voltor-7.


00:31:44.684 --> 00:31:46.752
Crazy beautiful,


00:31:46.786 --> 00:31:50.356
make the hairs on the back
of your neck stand up...


00:31:50.389 --> 00:31:53.527
until you felt a knife
right up in your balls.


00:31:53.560 --> 00:31:55.096
Lovely.


00:31:55.129 --> 00:31:57.298
Get to the point, convict.


00:31:57.333 --> 00:32:00.537
Point is these two stars...


00:32:02.373 --> 00:32:04.676
every 24 hours,
circle this planet,


00:32:04.710 --> 00:32:07.213
and they burn as hot
as the Earth's sun,


00:32:07.247 --> 00:32:10.083
so everything on the surface
of this planet


00:32:10.116 --> 00:32:11.719
is turned into space liquid.


00:32:11.752 --> 00:32:14.757
That's why the prisoners
live underground.


00:32:17.794 --> 00:32:19.562
So how long do we have?


00:32:19.596 --> 00:32:22.267
- Eh, my best guess...
- Eight hours, 20 minutes.


00:32:22.299 --> 00:32:23.769
Exactly.


00:32:23.802 --> 00:32:26.170
What? Oh.
Uh, it was my best guess, too.


00:32:28.609 --> 00:32:30.377
Easy, cupcake.


00:32:30.410 --> 00:32:32.648
Your nerve
will steady with age.


00:32:35.183 --> 00:32:38.154
Why are these shutters
not working?


00:32:38.187 --> 00:32:40.457
They're not gonna
get through them doors.


00:32:40.491 --> 00:32:42.828
They don't want
to destroy the ship.


00:33:01.821 --> 00:33:06.259
This is not good
for my anxiety.


00:33:06.292 --> 00:33:09.129
Why play it then,
My Magnificence?


00:33:28.657 --> 00:33:30.358
I lose my focus,


00:33:30.391 --> 00:33:33.731
and when I lose my focus,
I lose my temper!


00:33:41.606 --> 00:33:45.680
Shee, tell me about the ship.


00:33:45.713 --> 00:33:48.751
Or I should say "my new ship."


00:33:48.784 --> 00:33:51.521
Our new ship.


00:33:51.554 --> 00:33:53.958
Yes.


00:33:53.991 --> 00:33:55.727
Our new ship.


00:33:55.761 --> 00:33:57.830
That's more like it.


00:33:57.864 --> 00:34:01.669
The main part of the ship
was destroyed in the crash.


00:34:01.702 --> 00:34:04.238
What?!


00:34:04.271 --> 00:34:07.441
Remember who you
are speaking to.


00:34:07.475 --> 00:34:10.647
Remember what I did for you,
Your Greatness.


00:34:10.682 --> 00:34:13.550
Okay.


00:34:13.583 --> 00:34:14.753
I'm sorry.


00:34:14.787 --> 00:34:18.691
I'm just under a ton of stress.


00:34:20.360 --> 00:34:22.930
The control vessel
is still intact,


00:34:22.963 --> 00:34:25.567
so it will fly.


00:34:25.600 --> 00:34:28.471
Our time has come.


00:34:28.504 --> 00:34:33.878
Oh, so I will have my revenge.


00:34:37.316 --> 00:34:39.854
Shee, is this Max Cloud


00:34:39.887 --> 00:34:43.391
as handsome as they say he is?


00:34:48.032 --> 00:34:50.201
Sarah, can you hear me?


00:34:51.435 --> 00:34:53.604
Sarah, can you hear me?!
Are you there?!


00:34:53.637 --> 00:34:55.843
Stop shouting!


00:34:55.876 --> 00:34:58.644
Literally
no one was shouting.


00:34:58.679 --> 00:35:00.313
<i>I was freaking out, dude.</i>


00:35:00.346 --> 00:35:01.816
<i>I was speaking,
but I couldn't hear you.</i>


00:35:01.850 --> 00:35:03.351
<i>C-could you hear me?</i>


00:35:03.384 --> 00:35:04.987
<i>I was shouting your name.</i>


00:35:05.020 --> 00:35:08.659
No, I only just heard you
just now shouting in my ear.


00:35:08.693 --> 00:35:10.361
Thanks for that.


00:35:10.394 --> 00:35:12.064
Commander, was the power room
still intact


00:35:12.097 --> 00:35:13.767
when we lost
the rest of the ship?


00:35:13.800 --> 00:35:15.601
- Yes.
- Hmm.


00:35:15.634 --> 00:35:17.705
Now please won't one
of you masculine space heroes


00:35:17.738 --> 00:35:19.673
share your plan with the group?


00:35:19.707 --> 00:35:23.045
We get the power core,
we stick it in here,


00:35:23.079 --> 00:35:25.916
and we get the hell
out of Dodge.


00:35:25.949 --> 00:35:28.318
Surprisingly,
I agree with the pirate.


00:35:28.352 --> 00:35:30.487
Get used to it, Lulu.


00:35:30.521 --> 00:35:33.026
Now everybody tool up.


00:35:33.059 --> 00:35:34.928
The moment these doors open,


00:35:34.961 --> 00:35:37.031
we're gonna be
in a world of shit.


00:35:47.946 --> 00:35:50.817
The second sun
is closing in.


00:35:50.850 --> 00:35:53.687
Time is not our friend.


00:35:54.788 --> 00:35:56.858
Swarm the ship.


00:35:56.891 --> 00:36:00.562
Find every survivor,
and crush them.


00:36:00.595 --> 00:36:02.132
Rip out their spines.


00:36:02.165 --> 00:36:04.802
Cut out their hearts.


00:36:04.836 --> 00:36:07.571
Just don't damage the ship.


00:36:08.539 --> 00:36:10.810
If you do...


00:36:10.844 --> 00:36:13.546
I will eat your black hearts!


00:36:21.725 --> 00:36:22.926
Follow me.


00:36:25.698 --> 00:36:27.165
Hey.


00:36:27.198 --> 00:36:29.703
Who were you talking to
back there?


00:36:29.736 --> 00:36:32.439
I have an imaginary friend.


00:36:32.472 --> 00:36:33.808
What's their name, then?


00:36:33.841 --> 00:36:34.942
Instasquitch.


00:36:37.512 --> 00:36:38.715
Uh-huh.


00:36:41.218 --> 00:36:43.020
<i>Are you sure
about this, Cowboy?</i>


00:36:43.053 --> 00:36:45.456
Okay.


00:36:45.489 --> 00:36:47.927
<i>We can't see anything
down here.</i>


00:36:59.042 --> 00:37:00.044
Huh?


00:37:00.076 --> 00:37:01.178
Hey.


00:37:04.081 --> 00:37:06.185
I can't see. Hoo.


00:37:06.219 --> 00:37:08.087
Huh? Huh?


00:37:08.121 --> 00:37:09.156
Huh?


00:37:10.157 --> 00:37:11.959
Hey, hey, hey.


00:37:11.992 --> 00:37:13.661
Oh.


00:37:13.694 --> 00:37:14.864
Try these.


00:37:16.232 --> 00:37:18.467
Cowboy, Brock just
gave me his goggles.


00:37:18.501 --> 00:37:20.838
<i>Put 'em on. Put 'em on.</i>


00:37:20.872 --> 00:37:21.907
Oh.


00:37:25.912 --> 00:37:27.513
What do you see, kid?


00:37:27.546 --> 00:37:28.849
- Oh.
- What do you see?


00:37:37.928 --> 00:37:39.764
They found us.
Follow me.


00:37:40.865 --> 00:37:42.033
<i>There's smoke everywhere.</i>


00:37:42.067 --> 00:37:43.202
<i>Take us down a level.</i>


00:37:43.235 --> 00:37:45.038
Okay. Sure.


00:37:45.072 --> 00:37:46.740
<i>You need to get us
out of here.</i>


00:37:46.773 --> 00:37:48.276
<i>- It's like a maze.
- I know.</i>


00:37:48.309 --> 00:37:49.710
<i>Just keep us away
from them, Cowboy.</i>


00:37:49.744 --> 00:37:50.879
Yeah, I'm trying.


00:37:56.020 --> 00:37:57.053
<i>Cowboy, wait.</i>


00:37:57.087 --> 00:37:58.890
It's okay. I can see 'em.


00:38:00.691 --> 00:38:03.262
Should be safe here.


00:38:03.296 --> 00:38:05.064
<i>- They found us.
- Oh, wait! My bad!</i>


00:38:11.073 --> 00:38:12.507
This way, losers.


00:38:14.710 --> 00:38:16.713
Four against a team
of space ninjas.


00:38:16.748 --> 00:38:19.952
I like these odds.
What about you, team?


00:38:19.985 --> 00:38:21.620
Gotta know
your limits, kid.


00:38:22.653 --> 00:38:23.823
Ah.


00:38:23.857 --> 00:38:25.026
Uh...


00:38:25.059 --> 00:38:26.626
shit!


00:38:26.659 --> 00:38:28.196
I cannot believe
that I am complicit


00:38:28.230 --> 00:38:31.768
in this coward... Oh, shit!


00:38:41.781 --> 00:38:43.116
I know this room.


00:38:44.986 --> 00:38:46.087
Sarah, look out!


00:38:46.120 --> 00:38:47.289
<i>Do something!</i>


00:38:49.657 --> 00:38:50.894
Man...


00:38:55.699 --> 00:38:56.534
Commander?


00:39:11.021 --> 00:39:12.621
<i>Help!</i>


00:39:12.655 --> 00:39:14.393
<i>Max! Max, we're in here!</i>


00:39:14.426 --> 00:39:15.393
Huh?


00:39:43.398 --> 00:39:44.632
Huh?


00:40:09.133 --> 00:40:10.168
<i>Max!</i>


00:40:11.136 --> 00:40:12.237
<i>Hurry up!</i>


00:40:18.245 --> 00:40:20.248
Ho!


00:40:22.918 --> 00:40:24.387
<i>- Hello.
- Help!</i>


00:40:24.420 --> 00:40:26.256
<i>- Commander?
- Help us, Max!</i>


00:40:26.290 --> 00:40:29.294
Soldier, if you can hear me,


00:40:29.327 --> 00:40:34.466
do not fear! Max Cloud is here!


00:40:40.008 --> 00:40:41.311
Welcome back.


00:40:41.344 --> 00:40:43.246
<i>You got cajónes, amigo.</i>


00:40:43.279 --> 00:40:45.448
Oh, I wouldn't say that.
It was easy.


00:40:45.481 --> 00:40:48.420
Bigger they are,
the harder they fall.


00:40:48.453 --> 00:40:50.488
Ah, you ruined it.


00:40:52.892 --> 00:40:53.894
Oh.


00:40:53.927 --> 00:40:55.128
Hmm.


00:40:56.097 --> 00:40:57.932
Cowboy...


00:40:57.966 --> 00:40:59.034
Agh.


00:40:59.068 --> 00:41:00.803
Uh...


00:41:01.570 --> 00:41:02.806
what is he doing?


00:41:02.839 --> 00:41:04.140
Cowboy, turn me around.


00:41:04.174 --> 00:41:05.977
What the hell are you doing?


00:41:06.010 --> 00:41:07.512
- Uh, you okay there, kid?
- Yeah!


00:41:07.546 --> 00:41:10.250
Yeah, I'm just
checking out the wall.


00:41:10.283 --> 00:41:12.118
- Commander, what is he doing?
- Ow. Seriously, Cowboy.


00:41:12.151 --> 00:41:13.487
Cowboy, can you hear me?


00:41:13.520 --> 00:41:15.556
- Looks like he's rubbing...
- Cowboy.


00:41:15.589 --> 00:41:18.828
- himself up against the wall.
- Cowboy.


00:41:18.861 --> 00:41:22.032
<i>Cowboy,
can you hear me?</i>


00:41:22.065 --> 00:41:23.567
<i>Where are you?</i>


00:41:23.600 --> 00:41:24.936
<i>What are you doing?</i>


00:41:24.969 --> 00:41:26.405
Sarah, you still there?


00:41:27.873 --> 00:41:29.376
<i>What the hell?</i>


00:41:29.409 --> 00:41:32.078
Uh, my bad. But I was
gonna pee in my pants,


00:41:32.112 --> 00:41:33.948
and, uh, I knew
I had a few minutes


00:41:33.981 --> 00:41:35.383
while you were safe
in that room.


00:41:35.416 --> 00:41:37.052
<i>Don't do that again.</i>


00:41:37.085 --> 00:41:38.420
<i>This isn't a game.</i>


00:41:39.922 --> 00:41:41.025
Yeah.


00:41:45.130 --> 00:41:47.333
This vent's all, uh, checked.


00:41:47.366 --> 00:41:50.337
Quick jerking around.
We got work to do.


00:41:50.370 --> 00:41:52.273
Hang on.


00:41:52.307 --> 00:41:54.075
We need this first.


00:41:58.113 --> 00:41:59.182
Yes!


00:41:59.215 --> 00:42:01.051
<i>That was legit.</i>


00:42:01.084 --> 00:42:03.455
Yeah, uh, a little tap
would have done it, Cowboy.


00:42:03.488 --> 00:42:05.057
I gotta be honest
with you, soldier.


00:42:05.090 --> 00:42:07.527
That was pretty damn impressive.


00:42:07.560 --> 00:42:08.861
Watch this.


00:42:12.366 --> 00:42:13.535
Hmm.


00:42:14.904 --> 00:42:17.273
That was not impressive.


00:42:28.923 --> 00:42:30.558
Wait. Commander Rexy,


00:42:30.591 --> 00:42:32.861
is the core safe for handling?


00:42:36.699 --> 00:42:40.505
A safe distance of one meter
must be kept from the core


00:42:40.538 --> 00:42:43.376
at all times
to avoid contamination.


00:42:45.544 --> 00:42:46.980
Pussycats.


00:42:49.684 --> 00:42:51.085
The humiliation.


00:42:51.119 --> 00:42:52.988
A woman's taken the initiative.


00:42:53.021 --> 00:42:55.024
Commander,
have you lost your head?


00:42:55.058 --> 00:42:57.160
You're gonna lose yours
if you stay up here.


00:42:57.193 --> 00:42:58.596
Now come on, boys. Hurry up.


00:42:58.629 --> 00:43:00.098
In you go.


00:43:03.703 --> 00:43:05.405
Now you, Sarah.


00:43:08.742 --> 00:43:10.378
<i>Wrong tunnel.</i>


00:43:12.248 --> 00:43:13.950
<i>No, not yet, Cowboy.</i>


00:43:13.984 --> 00:43:15.353
Oh, come on.


00:43:19.624 --> 00:43:21.093
<i>Get us out of here.</i>


00:43:21.126 --> 00:43:23.296
Okay, guys, down you go.


00:43:25.433 --> 00:43:27.134
Yes. Finally.


00:43:27.168 --> 00:43:28.670
Out of my way, soldier.


00:43:28.703 --> 00:43:30.439
Hurry up, you lot!


00:43:41.321 --> 00:43:44.659
Oh, I should have never stopped
my aerobics classes.


00:43:44.692 --> 00:43:47.161
Okay.


00:43:52.803 --> 00:43:54.205
Ah.


00:43:54.238 --> 00:43:55.507
<i>What are you doing out there?</i>


00:43:55.540 --> 00:43:57.108
Just trying to help.


00:44:00.314 --> 00:44:01.514
<i>- Hello?
- Hello. 911.</i>


00:44:01.547 --> 00:44:03.350
<i>- Police?
- What?</i>


00:44:03.383 --> 00:44:05.453
<i>- Cowboy, hang up!
- This is gonna sound crazy,</i>


00:44:05.487 --> 00:44:08.457
<i>but my friend,
she's stuck in Max Cloud.</i>


00:44:08.491 --> 00:44:10.393
<i>- The video game?
- The video game, yeah.</i>


00:44:10.427 --> 00:44:12.429
<i>Cowboy, they
will think you're on drugs.</i>


00:44:12.462 --> 00:44:14.232
<i>They'll show up
and turn the game off.</i>


00:44:14.265 --> 00:44:16.167
<i>So, uh,
what can you tell me?</i>


00:44:16.200 --> 00:44:18.271
We're on the later stages,
and, uh, shit's getting crazy.


00:44:18.304 --> 00:44:20.173
<i>No, no, no,
this is a bad idea.</i>


00:44:20.206 --> 00:44:21.775
<i>- Okay, that's, uh...
- You know, uh,</i>


00:44:21.809 --> 00:44:24.111
just... just forget it.
I'm a... I'm a crazy person.


00:44:24.144 --> 00:44:26.715
<i>You know, wasting police time's
a criminal offense, sir.</i>


00:44:26.748 --> 00:44:30.220
<i>You can get fined $1,000,
so hang up now, please, son.</i>


00:44:30.254 --> 00:44:33.157
Yeah, okay.


00:44:37.631 --> 00:44:39.466
Sorry about that, Sarah.


00:44:39.499 --> 00:44:40.668
It's just you and me.


00:44:40.701 --> 00:44:42.436
<i>Well, that's good to hear.</i>


00:45:02.196 --> 00:45:04.465
Should we help?


00:45:04.500 --> 00:45:07.170
Nah. Just leave them to it.


00:45:07.203 --> 00:45:09.607
Max and Brock
have got this, okay?


00:45:11.209 --> 00:45:12.879
We've never got this far
before, Sarah.


00:45:12.912 --> 00:45:14.547
<i>I'm not gonna know
what's coming.</i>


00:45:14.581 --> 00:45:15.547
It's fine.


00:45:15.581 --> 00:45:16.683
We're gonna be fine.


00:45:16.716 --> 00:45:18.652
We just need to be relaxed.


00:45:18.686 --> 00:45:22.825
We need to focus, and we'll
get through it together, okay?


00:45:22.858 --> 00:45:24.627
These two actually love it.


00:45:26.862 --> 00:45:27.864
Hey!


00:45:27.899 --> 00:45:28.866
Ah.


00:45:31.870 --> 00:45:33.607
<i>They make it look easy.</i>


00:45:33.640 --> 00:45:36.343
So what was the point
in that back flip?


00:45:36.376 --> 00:45:38.446
Ho!


00:45:38.479 --> 00:45:40.215
Hmm. Working out?


00:45:41.651 --> 00:45:43.419
Shee!


00:45:43.453 --> 00:45:46.590
My reputation precedes me.


00:45:46.624 --> 00:45:48.928
But be assured...


00:45:48.961 --> 00:45:52.699
I am significantly crueler
than even the worst stories say.


00:45:52.733 --> 00:45:53.532
Great.


00:45:54.902 --> 00:45:57.471
Woah. She is terrifying
in the flesh.


00:45:57.504 --> 00:45:58.539
Ehh.


00:46:00.309 --> 00:46:04.381
Uh, Sarah, I'm kinda
freaking out right now.


00:46:04.414 --> 00:46:06.717
Okay.


00:46:06.751 --> 00:46:09.621
Come on.
Pull yourself together, Cowboy.


00:46:13.827 --> 00:46:15.964
Okay, come on.


00:46:15.997 --> 00:46:17.499
<i>We're gonna need</i>


00:46:17.532 --> 00:46:19.367
<i>more than fists
for this fight.</i>


00:46:19.401 --> 00:46:20.937
Plasma gun.


00:46:23.340 --> 00:46:25.710
Okay, don't forget.
R1 to reload.


00:46:25.743 --> 00:46:26.844
R1?


00:46:28.547 --> 00:46:31.284
J-just keep shooting.


00:46:31.317 --> 00:46:32.786
<i>I know. Duh.</i>


00:46:48.741 --> 00:46:50.677
Rexy!


00:46:52.780 --> 00:46:54.615
Let's do this, Cowboy.


00:47:12.673 --> 00:47:13.943
<i>That's what I'm talking about.</i>


00:47:13.976 --> 00:47:15.610
Rexy. Rexy!


00:47:17.346 --> 00:47:19.282
Brock, help. Rexy's hurt.


00:47:20.051 --> 00:47:21.786
Hey, it's okay.


00:47:21.819 --> 00:47:23.521
You're okay.


00:47:25.624 --> 00:47:27.392
Sarah!


00:47:27.426 --> 00:47:29.630
Brock's a bad guy?


00:47:29.663 --> 00:47:31.565
Sarah, are you okay?


00:47:33.435 --> 00:47:34.603
Ohh.


00:47:47.121 --> 00:47:48.723
Son of a bitch.


00:47:55.933 --> 00:47:57.935
You were late.


00:47:57.968 --> 00:48:00.006
What the hell?!


00:48:00.039 --> 00:48:02.607
The deal was
I get you the power core


00:48:02.641 --> 00:48:03.643
and you get me my...


00:48:03.676 --> 00:48:06.047
shiiiii...


00:48:12.655 --> 00:48:15.692
<i>- One...
- Top. Transfer across.</i>


00:48:15.725 --> 00:48:18.462
<i>- Work it. Oh, that core.
- Transfer mambo.</i>


00:48:18.496 --> 00:48:21.867
<i>Oh, yeah. Come on.
Basic toe, hup!</i>


00:48:21.900 --> 00:48:23.368
<i>- Hiyah.
- Pivot.</i>


00:48:23.402 --> 00:48:25.941
<i>Hoo! Great!</i>


00:48:25.974 --> 00:48:28.043
<i>- Pony on. Let's go.
- One, and go.</i>


00:48:28.076 --> 00:48:29.778
<i>Cross your top. Come on.</i>


00:48:29.811 --> 00:48:31.080
<i>Transfer across...</i>


00:48:31.113 --> 00:48:32.515
Revengor!


00:48:33.917 --> 00:48:35.652
<i>Again. Now one more time,
let's do it...</i>


00:48:35.686 --> 00:48:37.755
Shee, don't sneak up on me.


00:48:37.789 --> 00:48:39.825
<i>- It peaks my anxiety!
- Whoo!</i>


00:48:39.859 --> 00:48:41.728
<i>- It makes me jittery.
- Great. Pony on.</i>


00:48:41.761 --> 00:48:43.663
<i>Let's go. Cross your toes...</i>


00:48:43.697 --> 00:48:45.699
I assume the presence
of this space pirate


00:48:45.732 --> 00:48:47.135
means that you're almost done.


00:48:47.169 --> 00:48:48.904
<i>- Transfer mambo.
- Aw, Jesus.</i>


00:48:48.937 --> 00:48:50.806
Space cowboy, amigo.


00:48:50.839 --> 00:48:52.643
- Space cowboy.
- Ah.


00:48:52.676 --> 00:48:54.178
We've spoken
about this before.


00:48:54.211 --> 00:48:56.748
I am not having
a conversation with you


00:48:56.781 --> 00:48:59.719
whilst you're doing
whatever it is you're doing.


00:48:59.752 --> 00:49:04.425
I'm just working on my fitness
for my revenge on planet Earth.


00:49:04.459 --> 00:49:06.195
<i>- Ahh.
- Now back to body.</i>


00:49:06.228 --> 00:49:08.098
<i>- Come on, basic.
- I'm waiting.</i>


00:49:08.131 --> 00:49:10.066
<i>Pivot!</i>


00:49:10.100 --> 00:49:11.768
<i>Great!</i>


00:49:11.801 --> 00:49:13.004
<i>Pony on.</i>


00:49:16.108 --> 00:49:17.743
Go.


00:49:17.776 --> 00:49:20.947
The survivors were in possession
of a power core.


00:49:20.981 --> 00:49:23.884
Brock went in,
proved to be utterly useless,


00:49:23.918 --> 00:49:26.656
so I went to them myself
and destroyed it.


00:49:26.689 --> 00:49:28.058
We couldn't risk them escaping.


00:49:28.091 --> 00:49:29.458
And the ship?


00:49:29.492 --> 00:49:31.862
Yeah, what about my ship, Shee?


00:49:31.895 --> 00:49:33.464
What about our deal?


00:49:33.498 --> 00:49:35.733
The prisoners
are bringing it to us.


00:49:35.767 --> 00:49:38.470
Ah, the survivors.


00:49:38.504 --> 00:49:42.009
Including that devilishly
handsome Max Cloud?


00:49:42.043 --> 00:49:43.511
Taken care of.


00:49:43.544 --> 00:49:45.048
- Yeah.
- Woah, woah, woah.


00:49:45.081 --> 00:49:46.782
What does that mean?


00:49:46.815 --> 00:49:48.185
You said you wouldn't hurt them.


00:49:48.218 --> 00:49:49.987
Hush!


00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:52.490
Anything else?
I'm cooling down here.


00:49:53.258 --> 00:49:55.194
The ship won't be long...


00:49:56.263 --> 00:49:58.065
so make sure you're ready.


00:49:59.033 --> 00:50:01.235
I'll finish my video,
and then I'll pack.


00:50:02.937 --> 00:50:04.074
<i>Across the top.</i>


00:50:04.107 --> 00:50:05.674
Oh, and, Shee,


00:50:05.708 --> 00:50:09.046
why can I still
smell Donnelly? Huh?


00:50:09.080 --> 00:50:10.148
Ahh.


00:50:11.116 --> 00:50:12.650
<i>Across the back.</i>


00:50:12.683 --> 00:50:13.252
Yeah, back in your box.


00:50:17.257 --> 00:50:19.693
Uh, I don't want to add
to a bad situation,


00:50:19.727 --> 00:50:21.663
but Max is on his way.


00:50:24.867 --> 00:50:26.104
He took the power core.


00:50:26.137 --> 00:50:28.272
- Who?
- Brock.


00:50:28.306 --> 00:50:29.607
What happened?


00:50:29.640 --> 00:50:31.776
Brock betrayed us.


00:50:31.809 --> 00:50:33.947
- I told you!
- I didn't see it coming.


00:50:33.980 --> 00:50:36.150
I knew we shouldn't have
trusted that criminal.


00:50:36.183 --> 00:50:37.818
You should have listened
to me, Commander.


00:50:37.852 --> 00:50:40.256
He could have killed me.
He just stunned me.


00:50:40.289 --> 00:50:42.125
Come on. Brock can't be
a bad guy. That...


00:50:42.158 --> 00:50:44.061
Of course he's a bad guy.
He's left us!


00:50:44.094 --> 00:50:46.998
Abandoned us!
Left us to fry to death!


00:50:47.032 --> 00:50:48.066
It's over!


00:50:50.169 --> 00:50:52.139
There must be another way.


00:50:52.172 --> 00:50:54.841
Wh-why didn't Shee kill us?


00:50:56.144 --> 00:50:58.579
Come on! You're Max Cloud!


00:51:03.820 --> 00:51:06.891
Shee sent something else
to finish the job.


00:51:06.924 --> 00:51:08.161
- End of level...
- Boss.


00:51:09.328 --> 00:51:11.831
<i>Zuko! Zuko!</i>


00:51:17.772 --> 00:51:19.774
All right, let's do this.


00:51:21.211 --> 00:51:22.246
Come on.


00:51:25.149 --> 00:51:26.952
Hey, watch out.


00:51:26.985 --> 00:51:28.353
Guys, keep it going.


00:51:29.988 --> 00:51:32.126
Max, no!


00:51:37.133 --> 00:51:40.237
<i>Zuko Sumo Fudge.</i>


00:51:40.270 --> 00:51:41.306
We did it.


00:51:42.738 --> 00:51:44.943
We actually did it.


00:51:44.976 --> 00:51:46.245
<i>Yes!</i>


00:51:46.278 --> 00:51:48.048
<i>Well done, Cowboy.</i>


00:51:48.081 --> 00:51:50.217
I'm feeling
pretty darn confident right now.


00:51:50.250 --> 00:51:51.918
<i>Don't get complacent.</i>


00:51:51.952 --> 00:51:54.223
If I actually
get you out of here,


00:51:54.256 --> 00:51:55.991
you definitely owe me a date.


00:51:56.025 --> 00:51:57.427
Ehh? Wha...


00:51:57.460 --> 00:51:59.330
Max! Max is hurt!


00:51:59.363 --> 00:52:00.964
Huh.


00:52:00.997 --> 00:52:03.034
I'm fine. I'm fine.


00:52:03.068 --> 00:52:04.869
- Ohh!
- What are we gonna do now?


00:52:04.902 --> 00:52:06.738
Our only power core
has been destroyed,


00:52:06.771 --> 00:52:08.674
and this ship
isn't going anywhere.


00:52:08.708 --> 00:52:11.279
That's strange,
'cause we appear to be moving.


00:52:20.358 --> 00:52:22.994
That sun is getting
pretty damn close.


00:52:31.306 --> 00:52:33.975
Where are they taking us?


00:52:34.009 --> 00:52:35.744
<i>This must be it, Sarah.</i>


00:52:35.777 --> 00:52:38.082
<i>I saw something about it
in the game guide,</i>


00:52:38.116 --> 00:52:41.120
<i>the final levels,
Revengor's Lair.</i>


00:52:42.954 --> 00:52:44.690
They're taking us to Revengor.


00:52:45.859 --> 00:52:47.395
Revengor?


00:52:47.428 --> 00:52:49.863
He's just a myth.


00:52:49.896 --> 00:52:51.433
Doesn't mean he doesn't exist.


00:52:51.466 --> 00:52:53.902
<i>It might be
our only way out of here.</i>


00:52:53.936 --> 00:52:57.075
You better hope
that he does exist.


00:52:57.108 --> 00:53:00.213
'Cause right now, he may be
the only way out of here.


00:53:00.246 --> 00:53:05.185
And how exactly is Revengor
gonna help us get out of here?


00:53:11.827 --> 00:53:13.296
Okay, found it.


00:53:17.501 --> 00:53:19.870
Oh, backstory.


00:53:19.904 --> 00:53:23.277
"Revengor hasn't always
been known as Revengor.


00:53:23.310 --> 00:53:25.479
In fact,
he used to be called Jeremy."


00:53:25.512 --> 00:53:28.749
Well, he used to be
known as Jeremy.


00:53:30.052 --> 00:53:31.153
Jeremy?


00:53:31.187 --> 00:53:33.857
I'm not surprised.


00:53:33.890 --> 00:53:35.393
Nobody's gonna be scared
of a Jeremy.


00:53:35.426 --> 00:53:37.263
Revengor, yeah, but Jeremy...


00:53:37.296 --> 00:53:39.531
I'm sorry. What's this
got to do with anything?


00:53:39.565 --> 00:53:42.269
I'm trying to explain.


00:53:42.302 --> 00:53:44.538
"Before he ended up on Heinous,


00:53:44.572 --> 00:53:46.807
Jeremy worked for NASA
on planet Earth."


00:53:48.042 --> 00:53:50.580
Before he ended up on Heinous,


00:53:50.613 --> 00:53:53.816
Jeremy used to work for NASA
on planet Earth.


00:53:53.850 --> 00:53:56.121
He was taking his team out
on a mission,


00:53:56.154 --> 00:53:57.223
and they crash-landed.


00:53:58.190 --> 00:53:59.292
Long story short,


00:53:59.325 --> 00:54:01.927
no one ever came to rescue them,


00:54:01.961 --> 00:54:04.132
and he was
the only one to survive.


00:54:04.165 --> 00:54:07.336
Well, just about.


00:54:07.369 --> 00:54:09.539
He would have died
if it wasn't for Shee.


00:54:10.874 --> 00:54:12.176
When she found him,


00:54:12.209 --> 00:54:14.845
he was hardly breathing.


00:54:14.879 --> 00:54:16.548
Some of his limbs were missing.


00:54:17.617 --> 00:54:20.286
She used her sorcery
to fix him,


00:54:20.320 --> 00:54:22.223
bring him back up to strength.


00:54:22.257 --> 00:54:23.491
When she had...


00:54:25.059 --> 00:54:26.629
Jeremy was gone.


00:54:26.662 --> 00:54:28.264
This man was different.


00:54:28.297 --> 00:54:33.472
He was powerful, but empty,


00:54:33.505 --> 00:54:35.641
the kind of emptiness
which is dark,


00:54:35.674 --> 00:54:38.079
so dark that you
forget how to feel.


00:54:38.112 --> 00:54:40.147
Not totally surprising,


00:54:40.181 --> 00:54:42.650
considering he
doesn't have a heart.


00:54:42.683 --> 00:54:46.422
He survives off a power core
located in his chest.


00:54:48.024 --> 00:54:52.062
And so Revengor came to be.


00:54:52.097 --> 00:54:54.367
He took over the planet with
Shee as his right-hand woman,


00:54:54.400 --> 00:54:57.903
and together,
they rule the prisoners.


00:54:57.937 --> 00:55:00.509
"Ever since then, Revengor
has been waiting for a ship..."


00:55:00.542 --> 00:55:03.312
...so he can return to Earth
and get his revenge


00:55:03.345 --> 00:55:05.482
on the planet
that abandoned him.


00:55:05.515 --> 00:55:08.918
So we need to get
his power core


00:55:08.952 --> 00:55:10.988
before he gets our ship.


00:55:11.021 --> 00:55:13.426
Or planet Earth
is in mortal danger.


00:55:13.459 --> 00:55:16.362
The fate of the universe
lies in the hands of...


00:55:18.098 --> 00:55:20.301
Sorry. That... Habit.


00:55:21.269 --> 00:55:23.038
So what do we do now?


00:55:23.072 --> 00:55:24.674
We sit tight.


00:55:26.344 --> 00:55:27.978
<i>Hey, Sarah...</i>


00:55:28.011 --> 00:55:31.383
FYI, you just owned the room.


00:55:42.698 --> 00:55:44.934
So what's your real name, then?


00:55:46.470 --> 00:55:47.472
Jake.


00:55:47.505 --> 00:55:48.573
<i>She knows.</i>


00:55:48.606 --> 00:55:50.409
<i>H-how could she know?</i>


00:55:50.443 --> 00:55:53.447
<i>Tell her, Sarah.
She might be able to help.</i>


00:55:53.480 --> 00:55:55.516
I can't.


00:55:55.550 --> 00:55:58.554
See, who are you talking to
when you do that?


00:55:58.587 --> 00:56:02.225
What did you mean
when you said, "R1," earlier?


00:56:02.258 --> 00:56:03.661
Nothing. I-I didn't mean any...


00:56:03.694 --> 00:56:05.663
So it had nothing
to do with the fact


00:56:05.696 --> 00:56:07.766
that if you keep your finger
pressed down on R1 when firing,


00:56:07.799 --> 00:56:10.068
it will automatically
reload your weapon?


00:56:11.238 --> 00:56:13.373
How do you know that?


00:56:13.407 --> 00:56:14.609
I'm Sofia.


00:56:17.111 --> 00:56:18.247
I'm Sarah.


00:56:18.280 --> 00:56:20.081
- Sarah?
- Yeah.


00:56:21.251 --> 00:56:22.553
Nice to meet you, Sarah.


00:56:22.587 --> 00:56:24.589
Oh, my God.
It happened to you, too?


00:56:24.622 --> 00:56:27.024
I've got so many questions.


00:56:27.058 --> 00:56:28.460
I don't have many answers.


00:56:28.494 --> 00:56:30.196
Are there any more of us?


00:56:30.230 --> 00:56:33.133
Look, all I know
is that I've never


00:56:33.167 --> 00:56:34.803
met anyone else in here before,


00:56:34.836 --> 00:56:37.206
and the game characters,
they haven't got a clue.


00:56:37.240 --> 00:56:39.208
They're oblivious,
completely unaware.


00:56:39.242 --> 00:56:40.477
Have you been here long?


00:56:40.511 --> 00:56:42.112
Feels like forever.


00:56:42.146 --> 00:56:43.748
Okay.


00:56:43.781 --> 00:56:46.652
Well, we can't
be stuck here forever.


00:56:46.685 --> 00:56:48.555
I mean, there must be
a way out, right?


00:56:49.556 --> 00:56:51.056
What about the Space Witch?


00:56:51.090 --> 00:56:52.760
- Space Witch.
- Mm.


00:56:52.793 --> 00:56:55.430
That's the last thing I remember
before I ended up in here.


00:56:55.464 --> 00:56:57.166
<i>- Me, too.
- Hey, tell Sofia...</i>


00:56:57.200 --> 00:56:58.635
<i>Cowboy says, "What's up?"</i>


00:56:58.668 --> 00:57:00.271
<i>- Be quiet, Cowboy.
- Eh...</i>


00:57:00.304 --> 00:57:01.539
- Who's Cowboy?
- He's my best friend.


00:57:01.572 --> 00:57:03.073
- He's controlling me.
- Wait.


00:57:03.107 --> 00:57:04.142
Someone's controlling you
right now?


00:57:04.175 --> 00:57:05.510
Yeah.


00:57:05.544 --> 00:57:06.846
And you can communicate
with them?


00:57:06.879 --> 00:57:08.382
Is no one controlling you?


00:57:08.415 --> 00:57:10.217
No. I-I always played alone.
Hang on.


00:57:10.250 --> 00:57:13.755
So if... if your friend
can complete the game, then we...


00:57:13.788 --> 00:57:15.759
And we could find
the Space Witch!


00:57:15.792 --> 00:57:18.328
And then we might actually have
a chance of getting out of here!


00:57:19.297 --> 00:57:20.698
Yes!


00:57:20.731 --> 00:57:22.301
Please tell me
your friend's not shit.


00:57:41.293 --> 00:57:43.162
- Commander.
- How's the arm?


00:57:44.464 --> 00:57:45.832
It's fine.


00:57:47.467 --> 00:57:49.338
I'm sorry about Brock.


00:57:50.839 --> 00:57:52.542
It's not your fault.


00:57:52.575 --> 00:57:53.742
We weren't to know.


00:57:59.351 --> 00:58:01.920
So how does it feel...


00:58:01.953 --> 00:58:05.592
having this special
little moment with Max Cloud?


00:58:05.626 --> 00:58:07.195
Do you want
to finish it yourself?


00:58:07.228 --> 00:58:08.396
I'm messing with you.


00:58:10.366 --> 00:58:13.168
Well, that's something
I don't often see,


00:58:13.202 --> 00:58:14.304
little smile...


00:58:14.337 --> 00:58:17.775
from the unflappable Rexy.


00:58:19.712 --> 00:58:21.781
Can I ask you something?


00:58:21.814 --> 00:58:22.849
Sure.


00:58:24.417 --> 00:58:26.354
Why do you put on the act?


00:58:27.389 --> 00:58:29.425
What act? I'm Max Cloud,


00:58:29.458 --> 00:58:31.460
- intergalactic space hero...
- Come on.


00:58:32.663 --> 00:58:34.165
There's nobody else here.


00:58:36.934 --> 00:58:38.903
You really want to know?


00:58:38.936 --> 00:58:40.840
I really want to know.


00:58:43.309 --> 00:58:45.847
I never really wanted all this.


00:58:45.881 --> 00:58:50.386
Being a space hero doesn't
exactly come naturally to me.


00:58:51.354 --> 00:58:52.756
So what does?


00:58:54.792 --> 00:58:55.827
Pastry.


00:58:57.662 --> 00:58:59.866
- Pastry?
- Mm-hmm.


00:58:59.900 --> 00:59:01.735
I get pastry.


00:59:01.768 --> 00:59:04.605
Always have, always will,
ever since I was a little kid.


00:59:07.776 --> 00:59:11.449
You know,
my mother was a pastry chef.


00:59:11.482 --> 00:59:14.486
When I was younger,
I used to love nothing more


00:59:14.519 --> 00:59:16.488
than helping her in the kitchen.


00:59:16.521 --> 00:59:19.259
The attention to detail.


00:59:19.293 --> 00:59:21.995
Watching her tiny hands
quickly shape


00:59:22.029 --> 00:59:25.400
the most intricate
and delicate of pastries.


00:59:26.702 --> 00:59:29.740
The Mille feuilles
to Paris-Brest.


00:59:29.773 --> 00:59:32.009
Oh, and her Madeleines...


00:59:32.043 --> 00:59:34.713
well,
they were lighter than air.


00:59:36.348 --> 00:59:37.817
She made it like an art.


00:59:38.852 --> 00:59:40.821
All I wanted to do in life


00:59:40.855 --> 00:59:42.690
was to be able to bake pastries


00:59:42.723 --> 00:59:45.561
as elegant
and as beautiful as hers.


00:59:48.098 --> 00:59:49.801
But after she died,


00:59:49.834 --> 00:59:52.370
I would sneak into the kitchen
and bake alone


00:59:52.403 --> 00:59:54.673
until one night,
my father found me,


00:59:54.707 --> 00:59:57.610
and he sent me off
to space academy.


00:59:57.643 --> 01:00:00.548
Now here I am,
intergalactic space hero,


01:00:00.581 --> 01:00:03.385
but I've not baked
a pastry since.


01:00:04.988 --> 01:00:07.625
You have no idea
how much I envy Jake


01:00:07.658 --> 01:00:09.460
in that kitchen all day.


01:00:09.493 --> 01:00:11.963
I'm sure you can go
in the kitchen if you want to.


01:00:11.997 --> 01:00:14.634
Space heroes don't have time
for baking, okay?


01:00:14.667 --> 01:00:16.936
You're allowed
to pass the ball, Max.


01:00:16.969 --> 01:00:18.740
Oh, yeah?


01:00:18.773 --> 01:00:19.808
Look who's talking.


01:00:22.478 --> 01:00:24.113
- You know what?
- What?


01:00:24.146 --> 01:00:25.816
If you were someone different...


01:00:25.849 --> 01:00:27.818
- Yeah?
- we might have been friends.


01:00:43.439 --> 01:00:47.411
Revengor's Lair
or Space Slug Smackdown?


01:00:48.546 --> 01:00:50.648
Oh, no, stupid.
What am I thinking?


01:00:50.682 --> 01:00:53.453
Always Revengor's Lair.


01:00:54.821 --> 01:00:58.794
Ah, Stars and Sunbeams?


01:00:58.827 --> 01:01:02.098
I've always found that
quite relaxing.


01:01:02.131 --> 01:01:07.072
That might help calm me down
after a hard day's revenging.


01:01:07.105 --> 01:01:09.941
Maybe I could take it
out of the box.


01:01:09.975 --> 01:01:12.012
Ah, that's crazy talk.


01:01:12.045 --> 01:01:14.181
What am I saying?


01:01:18.153 --> 01:01:19.856
- The ship has arrived.
- Ah.


01:01:19.890 --> 01:01:25.730
Ah, the moment
we've been waiting for, Shee,


01:01:25.763 --> 01:01:28.700
it's finally here.


01:01:28.734 --> 01:01:32.005
Nothing can stop us now.


01:01:33.107 --> 01:01:35.010
I woke up this morning,


01:01:35.043 --> 01:01:40.617
and I knew today was
gonna be a wonderful day


01:01:40.651 --> 01:01:43.654
full of death and retribution.


01:01:43.687 --> 01:01:46.226
You will be
a magnificent captain.


01:01:46.259 --> 01:01:47.993
Yes, I know.


01:01:49.230 --> 01:01:50.931
Earth will rue the day


01:01:50.964 --> 01:01:53.968
they ever left me
to rot on Heinous.


01:01:54.001 --> 01:01:56.571
It will always be your Heinous.


01:01:56.606 --> 01:01:58.040
Our Heinous.


01:01:59.542 --> 01:02:03.715
And soon it will be our Earth.


01:02:06.819 --> 01:02:09.556
I feel like celebrating.


01:02:23.910 --> 01:02:26.045
I don't know
if I can do this, Sarah.


01:02:26.079 --> 01:02:29.883
<i>What happened to, "I'm feeling
pretty darn confident now"?</i>


01:02:29.917 --> 01:02:31.852
That was
postbattle buzz talking.


01:02:31.885 --> 01:02:35.224
But now I know we're heading
into Revengor's Lair.


01:02:35.258 --> 01:02:38.529
I don't think you realize
how serious this is.


01:02:38.563 --> 01:02:41.300
If we lose this game,
we lose you, too,


01:02:41.333 --> 01:02:44.270
and I don't know
what I'd do if...


01:02:44.304 --> 01:02:46.606
<i>I believe in you, Cowboy.</i>


01:02:48.576 --> 01:02:50.878
Okay.


01:02:50.911 --> 01:02:53.716
Okay, but you can't blame me
if I pee on your carpet.


01:02:53.750 --> 01:02:55.118
- Oh, yes, I can.
- Tony!


01:02:55.151 --> 01:02:58.055
Uh, Tony's here.
Your dad's here.


01:02:58.088 --> 01:02:59.223
<i>Damn it.</i>


01:02:59.258 --> 01:03:00.825
Watch those cuss words, Sarah.


01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:02.762
- Where is she?
- Uh...


01:03:02.795 --> 01:03:04.965
And you know you're not supposed
to be playing this weekend.


01:03:04.998 --> 01:03:06.133
Turn it off, please, Cowboy.


01:03:06.166 --> 01:03:08.904
I-I can't. If we turn it off,


01:03:08.937 --> 01:03:11.206
she'll die
and be stuck in there forever.


01:03:11.240 --> 01:03:12.808
What are you talking about?


01:03:12.841 --> 01:03:14.077
Just save the game,
and turn it off.


01:03:14.110 --> 01:03:16.113
Uh...


01:03:16.147 --> 01:03:19.084
And, Sarah, you better get
out here right now, young lady,


01:03:19.117 --> 01:03:20.886
or you're gonna be
in big trouble.


01:03:20.919 --> 01:03:24.157
<i>Yeah, that's sort of
not possible right now.</i>


01:03:24.190 --> 01:03:25.993
Fine. I'll turn it off.


01:03:26.026 --> 01:03:27.729
No, no, no, no, no, no.


01:03:27.761 --> 01:03:29.765
- Sorry.
- Out of my way, Cowboy.


01:03:29.799 --> 01:03:32.034
<i>Dad, it's me. I'm in the game.</i>


01:03:32.068 --> 01:03:33.203
What?


01:03:33.236 --> 01:03:36.039
Look, Tony, you gotta listen.


01:03:36.073 --> 01:03:37.708
What the heck is going on?


01:03:37.742 --> 01:03:40.313
Just please, please listen
to your daughter.


01:03:40.346 --> 01:03:43.149
<i>Dad, it really is me.
I'm stuck in here.</i>


01:03:43.183 --> 01:03:44.652
<i>You have to believe me.</i>


01:03:44.685 --> 01:03:46.921
She's inside the game.


01:03:46.954 --> 01:03:51.160
Now, I know this sounds crazy,
okay, but, uh...


01:03:53.965 --> 01:03:55.700
- Just...
- Sarah?


01:03:58.203 --> 01:03:59.271
You there, sweetie?


01:03:59.306 --> 01:04:01.342
<i>I-I can hear you, Dad.</i>


01:04:01.375 --> 01:04:03.176
<i>Please don't turn off the game.</i>


01:04:03.210 --> 01:04:05.646
<i>I don't want to be trapped
in here forever.</i>


01:04:05.680 --> 01:04:07.649
<i>- I want to come home.
- Okay.</i>


01:04:07.683 --> 01:04:09.352
Okay, trust me, honey.


01:04:09.385 --> 01:04:12.290
Cowboy, open that package
over there.


01:04:12.324 --> 01:04:14.225
Okay.


01:04:14.258 --> 01:04:15.361
Sarah...


01:04:17.262 --> 01:04:19.031
I have a confession to make.


01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:23.071
I'm a gamer, Sarah.


01:04:23.104 --> 01:04:25.807
Always have been.
Always will be.


01:04:25.840 --> 01:04:28.978
<i>Huh. This makes sense now.</i>


01:04:29.011 --> 01:04:32.215
<i>So that's what you and Mom
were always arguing about.</i>


01:04:32.249 --> 01:04:34.920
Only because of what
it did to me, honey.


01:04:34.953 --> 01:04:36.456
We'll talk about this later.


01:04:36.489 --> 01:04:39.125
Right now,
we gotta finish this game


01:04:39.159 --> 01:04:41.061
and get you home.


01:04:41.095 --> 01:04:42.164
You ready?


01:04:42.197 --> 01:04:43.932
<i>I'm ready, Dad.</i>


01:04:44.900 --> 01:04:46.403
<i>Let's do this.</i>


01:04:52.243 --> 01:04:53.413
Oh, man.


01:05:03.125 --> 01:05:06.229
Okay.
Big Tony, you got this.


01:05:06.262 --> 01:05:07.263
You got this.


01:05:12.805 --> 01:05:14.341
That's it. Relax.


01:05:14.374 --> 01:05:17.744
End the game.
I know you can do this.


01:05:20.882 --> 01:05:22.251
Are the walls moving?


01:05:23.252 --> 01:05:24.787
What are you talking about?


01:05:24.820 --> 01:05:26.990
The walls aren't...


01:05:27.023 --> 01:05:28.960
The walls are moving.


01:05:28.993 --> 01:05:32.297
Shh! Quiet, Rexy. Quiet.


01:05:32.332 --> 01:05:34.501
We need to freak out quietly.


01:05:34.535 --> 01:05:36.337
Slug... Ahh! Ohh!


01:05:48.186 --> 01:05:51.123
I hope this doesn't
come off as weird, Tony,


01:05:51.156 --> 01:05:53.293
but you are magnificent.


01:06:06.910 --> 01:06:09.914
I-I'm never gonna
feel clean again.


01:06:09.948 --> 01:06:11.518
You hear that?


01:06:13.353 --> 01:06:14.988
Stick with me.


01:06:15.022 --> 01:06:16.525
We've got your back, Max.


01:06:27.407 --> 01:06:29.475
Come on, Brock.


01:06:29.509 --> 01:06:32.211
Pirates like to dance.


01:06:32.245 --> 01:06:34.114
Show us some moves.


01:06:48.501 --> 01:06:50.437
Oh, yeah.


01:06:50.470 --> 01:06:52.138
Party on.


01:06:54.476 --> 01:06:56.912
Let's huddle.


01:06:56.945 --> 01:07:00.183
Okay, what do you think
we should do, Rexy?


01:07:00.217 --> 01:07:01.318
- Really?
- Yeah.


01:07:01.353 --> 01:07:03.220
You're smarter than I am.


01:07:03.253 --> 01:07:05.591
Just took me a while to get
my head out of my own ass.


01:07:05.624 --> 01:07:07.326
- Thanks, Max.
- Mm.


01:07:07.361 --> 01:07:10.197
I think we should
go with Jake on this one.


01:07:10.230 --> 01:07:12.066
I say we do it
the Max Cloud way,


01:07:12.100 --> 01:07:14.335
loud, brash,
straight in the front door.


01:07:14.370 --> 01:07:15.605
Who's with me?


01:07:15.638 --> 01:07:17.507
The Max Cloud way.


01:07:22.079 --> 01:07:23.982
Bit much.


01:07:24.015 --> 01:07:25.518
The Max Cloud way!


01:07:25.551 --> 01:07:27.522
- Hyah!
- Yay!


01:07:42.709 --> 01:07:44.644
Woah!


01:07:44.677 --> 01:07:46.680
Hey, Jeremy!


01:07:46.714 --> 01:07:49.016
Give me back my ship!


01:07:49.049 --> 01:07:52.087
Now there's a name
I haven't heard in a long time.


01:07:53.188 --> 01:07:55.359
It's not as bad as I remember.


01:07:55.392 --> 01:07:58.563
Jeremy Revengor.


01:07:58.596 --> 01:08:01.065
Hmm.


01:08:01.099 --> 01:08:04.303
Oh, Max...


01:08:04.336 --> 01:08:08.544
you truly are as handsome
as they say.


01:08:08.577 --> 01:08:10.111
That's right.


01:08:10.144 --> 01:08:11.980
I am beautiful!


01:08:12.014 --> 01:08:14.485
So you'd better take
a goddamn good look,


01:08:14.518 --> 01:08:16.755
'cause it's the last thing
you're ever gonna see!


01:08:23.464 --> 01:08:26.066
Someone bring me his face.


01:08:27.101 --> 01:08:29.538
"Taken care of," you said.


01:08:31.140 --> 01:08:34.244
The disappointment
is overwhelming.


01:08:46.328 --> 01:08:48.063
Hah! Uhh!


01:08:53.404 --> 01:08:56.174
Shee.


01:08:56.207 --> 01:08:58.209
That was a bit embarrassing.


01:08:58.243 --> 01:08:59.479
Take a timeout.


01:09:30.655 --> 01:09:32.088
Hah!


01:09:35.761 --> 01:09:38.097
Oh, what the hell is this?


01:09:41.870 --> 01:09:43.572
A conscience.


01:09:46.208 --> 01:09:48.445
Where the hell'd that come from?


01:09:50.481 --> 01:09:51.516
No!


01:09:55.219 --> 01:09:56.590
- Max!
- Max!


01:09:56.623 --> 01:09:59.359
Bummer.


01:10:17.584 --> 01:10:19.386
Uh, really?


01:10:20.355 --> 01:10:22.256
Last chance, Shee.


01:10:25.294 --> 01:10:26.731
There she is.


01:10:28.633 --> 01:10:31.704
Look who has grown a spine.


01:10:31.738 --> 01:10:34.374
Come to claim your bounty,
pirate?


01:10:35.510 --> 01:10:38.278
Come on, Shee. Shee!


01:10:41.584 --> 01:10:42.786
Is that all you got?


01:10:43.820 --> 01:10:45.523
Come on, Shee.


01:10:50.463 --> 01:10:51.598
Impossible.


01:10:51.631 --> 01:10:53.634
Oh, it's possible, darlin'.


01:10:55.770 --> 01:10:57.673
Brock Donnelly...


01:10:57.706 --> 01:10:59.676
never misses a bounty.


01:11:02.745 --> 01:11:04.549
The record stands.


01:11:13.927 --> 01:11:15.664
Much obliged, darlin'.


01:11:15.698 --> 01:11:17.633
Anytime.


01:11:24.909 --> 01:11:27.245
<i>- I got this.
- We got this.</i>


01:11:27.279 --> 01:11:30.751
<i>Every game, every final level,
every boss...</i>


01:11:31.753 --> 01:11:32.953
<i>it was all for this.</i>


01:11:32.986 --> 01:11:35.024
I get to fight that guy


01:11:35.057 --> 01:11:36.792
or even that guy.


01:11:36.826 --> 01:11:40.262
I fight the main guy,
not the sidekicks.


01:11:40.296 --> 01:11:42.533
We don't have sidekicks.
We're a team.


01:11:42.567 --> 01:11:44.737
Brock, get the others
to the ship.


01:11:44.770 --> 01:11:46.706
Stand by.
I'm gonna get the power core.


01:11:46.740 --> 01:11:47.774
- Let's dance!
- Woah, woah.


01:11:47.807 --> 01:11:49.877
Easy there, amigo.


01:11:49.910 --> 01:11:51.979
You cannot take Jeremy
on your own.


01:11:52.012 --> 01:11:54.282
Yes, he can.


01:11:54.316 --> 01:11:55.382
You've got this.


01:11:57.053 --> 01:11:59.857
Confidence.


01:11:59.890 --> 01:12:02.594
Good. Good for you.


01:12:12.708 --> 01:12:14.543
What happened?


01:12:14.576 --> 01:12:16.012
Did I save the universe again?


01:12:16.045 --> 01:12:17.514
- You were fantastic.
- Ah.


01:12:17.547 --> 01:12:19.517
Let's go


01:12:21.653 --> 01:12:23.589
Fabulous.


01:12:23.623 --> 01:12:26.325
<i>Dad? Dad!
What's going on?</i>


01:12:26.359 --> 01:12:29.898
No. This can't be happening,
not now.


01:12:29.931 --> 01:12:31.366
Wh-what do we do?


01:12:36.540 --> 01:12:37.507
Oh, my God.


01:12:37.541 --> 01:12:38.943
<i>Round one.</i>


01:12:38.976 --> 01:12:40.478
I'm controlling myself.


01:12:40.511 --> 01:12:42.080
<i>Ready.</i>


01:12:42.114 --> 01:12:43.649
<i>Fight!</i>


01:12:45.384 --> 01:12:46.419
Ow!


01:12:47.988 --> 01:12:49.057
Ow!


01:12:52.460 --> 01:12:54.363
<i>- Yeah!
- Good work!</i>


01:13:04.044 --> 01:13:05.046
Ow!


01:13:05.079 --> 01:13:06.079
<i>Finish him.</i>


01:13:08.851 --> 01:13:10.719
<i>You win.</i>


01:13:12.622 --> 01:13:15.092
<i>Next round.</i>


01:13:15.125 --> 01:13:17.127
<i>Ready.</i>


01:13:17.161 --> 01:13:18.663
<i>Fight.</i>


01:13:18.697 --> 01:13:20.866
I'll get you!


01:13:20.899 --> 01:13:22.367
Have this!


01:13:39.658 --> 01:13:42.696
You are nothing!


01:13:43.664 --> 01:13:45.432
<i>You lose.</i>


01:13:49.071 --> 01:13:50.940
<i>Pick yourself up.</i>


01:13:52.542 --> 01:13:54.946
Is that all you've got?


01:13:54.979 --> 01:13:59.586
This is why I wanted
to fight the main guy.


01:13:59.619 --> 01:14:00.954
<i>Final round.</i>


01:14:00.987 --> 01:14:02.656
<i>Fight!</i>


01:14:04.793 --> 01:14:07.095
Okay, look for
the pattern, Sarah.


01:14:13.570 --> 01:14:15.073
Here we go.


01:14:23.284 --> 01:14:25.486
Want some more?


01:14:28.892 --> 01:14:33.699
I will destroy you.


01:14:40.107 --> 01:14:41.810
<i>Good move.</i>


01:14:45.247 --> 01:14:49.186
You are irritating. Fight me!


01:14:58.898 --> 01:15:00.902
<i>Finish him.</i>


01:15:06.743 --> 01:15:07.845
Hah!


01:15:16.023 --> 01:15:17.858
<i>Power move!</i>


01:15:17.891 --> 01:15:19.260
Huh?


01:15:19.293 --> 01:15:21.630
Not the only one
that can ride a glitch.


01:15:26.937 --> 01:15:28.806
<i>Perfect!</i>


01:15:31.677 --> 01:15:33.646
Well, that was not ex...


01:15:37.151 --> 01:15:38.753
<i>You win!</i>


01:15:45.763 --> 01:15:47.732
<i>We lost you.
How did you get...</i>


01:15:47.765 --> 01:15:49.701
<i>You know what? Tell me later.</i>


01:15:49.735 --> 01:15:51.804
<i>Let's get you off this planet,
complete this game,</i>


01:15:51.837 --> 01:15:53.206
<i>and get you home.</i>


01:15:53.239 --> 01:15:55.976
Yeah. I could not
agree with you more.


01:16:07.926 --> 01:16:09.762
God, I wish
I could do something!


01:16:09.795 --> 01:16:11.698
Commander...


01:16:11.731 --> 01:16:12.967
it's been an honor.


01:16:13.000 --> 01:16:15.002
I wish I could say the same.


01:16:17.673 --> 01:16:19.342
- Anyone order a power core?
- Yes, Sarah!


01:16:19.375 --> 01:16:21.411
Great work, kid!


01:16:21.444 --> 01:16:24.316
Right. Time to go home.
Where's Brock?


01:16:24.349 --> 01:16:26.151
He dumped Shee here
and left us again.


01:16:26.184 --> 01:16:28.054
And, hey, who's Sarah?


01:16:31.725 --> 01:16:34.162
All right, soldiers,
hold on to your butts.


01:16:34.195 --> 01:16:35.798
Let's do this.


01:16:37.366 --> 01:16:39.169
Max?


01:16:39.202 --> 01:16:41.271
Looks like we're still coupled
to the rest of the ship.


01:16:41.304 --> 01:16:44.108
Somebody's gonna have to
get out there and deal with it.


01:16:46.411 --> 01:16:48.381
Max, what do we do?
What do we do?!


01:16:48.414 --> 01:16:51.017
<i>- Uh...
- Caution. Caution.</i>


01:16:51.050 --> 01:16:53.355
It's that space pirate.


01:16:53.388 --> 01:16:55.056
What the hell is he doing?!


01:17:22.460 --> 01:17:27.301
Yee-hoo!


01:17:38.416 --> 01:17:40.117
He saved us.


01:17:41.954 --> 01:17:43.922
I was wrong about him.


01:17:51.132 --> 01:17:52.400
Something's at the door.


01:17:53.469 --> 01:17:54.870
Helmets on.


01:18:25.012 --> 01:18:27.148
- You're alive!
- Ooh, yeah.


01:18:27.181 --> 01:18:28.883
Yeah, yeah, yeah.


01:18:28.916 --> 01:18:30.386
Easy, son.


01:18:30.419 --> 01:18:34.024
But you were fully on fire.


01:18:34.057 --> 01:18:35.426
Yeah.


01:18:36.394 --> 01:18:38.130
I am Brock Donnelly.


01:18:38.163 --> 01:18:39.465
Hah!


01:18:39.499 --> 01:18:42.303
Now that was lame.


01:18:42.336 --> 01:18:44.271
That was not an explanation.


01:18:55.286 --> 01:18:58.358
There are worse places
to be stuck for all eternity.


01:18:58.391 --> 01:19:01.094
I just thought
if we completed the game,


01:19:01.127 --> 01:19:04.165
then that would be it,
we get to go home.


01:19:07.169 --> 01:19:08.605
Dad, C-Cowboy...


01:19:10.273 --> 01:19:11.408
can you hear me?


01:19:14.211 --> 01:19:15.580
Looks like I'm stuck here.


01:19:17.515 --> 01:19:19.419
I'm so sorry, Sarah.


01:19:22.089 --> 01:19:23.257
No one's to blame.


01:19:24.694 --> 01:19:27.263
This is where I get off, amigo.


01:19:27.297 --> 01:19:29.933
Really? You're not staying?


01:19:29.966 --> 01:19:32.903
You know, I think you'd make
a great addition to the team.


01:19:39.446 --> 01:19:41.548
Old Brock Donnelly's
a lone wolf.


01:19:43.452 --> 01:19:44.620
Besides...


01:19:47.324 --> 01:19:49.994
I got to go collect
that bounty on Shee...


01:19:51.462 --> 01:19:53.399
and get my ship back.


01:19:53.432 --> 01:19:56.936
You know, Brock,
after what you've done for us,


01:19:56.970 --> 01:19:59.172
I can get you
any ship in the galaxy.


01:20:02.010 --> 01:20:06.315
Mine ain't
no ordinary ship.


01:20:15.663 --> 01:20:17.464
Looks like I'm going
to spend all of eternity


01:20:17.497 --> 01:20:20.670
looking for that...


01:20:23.305 --> 01:20:25.241
Space Witch.


01:20:42.800 --> 01:20:44.367
Sarah!


01:20:44.401 --> 01:20:48.172
My dad,
the world's greatest gamer.


01:20:49.308 --> 01:20:51.044
I'm sorry, sweetheart.


01:20:51.077 --> 01:20:52.144
Me, too.


01:20:53.146 --> 01:20:54.582
Hey!


01:21:00.155 --> 01:21:03.125
Man, it feels so good
to not be in that spacesuit.


01:21:03.159 --> 01:21:04.361
Sofia.


01:21:05.630 --> 01:21:07.265
You must be Sarah.


01:21:07.298 --> 01:21:10.135
And we're in your room
right now?


01:21:10.169 --> 01:21:12.172
You're a full grown-up.


01:21:12.205 --> 01:21:14.074
And you must be Cowboy.


01:21:14.107 --> 01:21:16.679
I guess I should thank you
for getting us out of there.


01:21:16.713 --> 01:21:18.781
Well, it was a team effort.


01:21:22.853 --> 01:21:24.321
- Tony.
- Uh...


01:21:24.355 --> 01:21:25.389
Sagittarius.


01:21:25.422 --> 01:21:26.826
Ah. Well, you certainly


01:21:26.859 --> 01:21:29.428
must know your way
around a joystick, Tony.


01:21:35.203 --> 01:21:37.138
- You ready?
- Fully ready.


01:21:40.543 --> 01:21:42.078
The Captain Tony way.


01:21:43.347 --> 01:21:46.151
What? I-I miss the accent.


01:21:47.153 --> 01:21:48.621
Oh, you were doing a...


01:21:48.656 --> 01:21:49.857
British accent?


01:21:49.890 --> 01:21:51.659
Hey. Hey, I'm good at it.


01:21:54.262 --> 01:21:55.831
One second.


01:21:58.835 --> 01:22:00.504
Sarah.


01:22:00.537 --> 01:22:02.173
Uh, guys!


01:22:02.206 --> 01:22:03.809
- Oh!
- Dad!


01:22:03.842 --> 01:22:05.812
What have I told you
about knocking?


01:22:05.845 --> 01:22:08.481
Sorry, sweetie. You guys ready?


01:22:08.515 --> 01:22:10.851
We don't want to be late
for the games convention.


01:22:10.885 --> 01:22:13.121
Okay. We're coming.


01:22:13.155 --> 01:22:15.457
We were just about to take
things to the next level.


01:22:15.490 --> 01:22:16.593
Excuse me?


01:22:16.626 --> 01:22:19.296
Uh, that's a games-related joke.


01:22:19.330 --> 01:22:21.565
I would never disrespect you
like that, Tony,


01:22:21.599 --> 01:22:23.368
you... you brilliant,
brilliant man.


01:28:37.309 --> 01:28:39.278
Do not fear!


01:28:39.312 --> 01:28:42.149
Max Cloud is here!


01:28:42.248 --> 01:28:45.436
Subtitles by explosiveskull

